f:6: error: meta.instance.ref.pattern: bad pattern (: error: unclosed group (CFG-7)
f:6: error: meta.instance.ref.param: ref param state clashes with enter's own param — pick another name, e.g. issueId (CFG-13)
f:8: error: meta.events.pause: built-in event pause may override only its description, not its params (IDLE-1)
f:13: error: meta.events.go.params.properties.n: param n has type integer; v1 params are strings — use type: string, with enum or pattern to constrain it (CFG-16)
f:14: error: meta.events.go.params.properties.e: enum is empty (CFG-7)
f:15: error: meta.events.go.params.required: required param missing is not in properties (CFG-7)
f:19: error: states.A.entry: setRef runs only in a transition's actions under `on` — it takes the ref from the event's ref param, which entry, exit and always have none of (CFG-4)
f:21: error: states.A.on.pause: pause is a built-in event; its name is reserved (CFG-13)
f:23: error: states.A.on.go.guard: visits counts unknown state NOPE (CFG-5)
f:22: error: states.A.on.go: the last transition has a guard, so nothing happens when every guard fails — end the list with an unguarded transition (e.g. back to this state) (CFG-13)
f:25: error: states.A.on.loose: target state Z does not exist (CFG-3)
f:27: error: states.A.meta.paramDescriptions.go.ghost: go declares no param ghost — declare params in meta.events; paramDescriptions only rewords their prompts (CFG-8)
f:32: error: states.F1: a final state has no on or always (CFG-12)
f:32: error: states.F1: the fallback state must not be final (CFG-13)
f:38: warning: states.F2.entry: text contains `</smllm>`, which smllm uses to fence agent text — reword it so the agent can tell smllm's text from yours (TURN-12)
f:36: error: states.F2: only one state may be the fallback (also F1) (CFG-13)
f:16: warning: meta.events.unused: event unused is declared but no state uses it (CFG-9)
f:29: error: states.B.always: always transitions loop: B → C → B — an always state is never rested in; break the loop with an event (DEC-2)
